we got a new suggestion for a model viewer as an alternative to our own glTF renderer. Can we use it for project "Cornwall Wind turbine Pilot #3" (which we need to rename to "London Wind turbine Pilot #3)  on page `projects/3/digital-twin`

All I got to make it work within their sandbox was this code snippet:
```
import * as Cesium from "cesium";



const viewer = new Cesium.Viewer("cesiumContainer", {

  terrain: Cesium.Terrain.fromWorldTerrain(),

});



Cesium.Ion.defaultAccessToken = 'REDACTED';



const tileset = viewer.scene.primitives.add(

  await Cesium.Cesium3DTileset.fromIonAssetId(4764199),

);



viewer.zoomTo(tileset);
```

